msgctxt "instalado_resumo"
msgid ""
"  Tandem installed.\n"
"\n"
"    Double-click a .exe or .msi     -> runs on Windows (Wine)\n"
"    Double-click a .apk or .xapk    -> installs on Android\n"
"    Double-click a .AppImage        -> runs directly, nothing to install\n"
"    Double-click a .jar             -> runs on Java\n"
"    Double-click a .deb             -> installs, checking first\n"
"    Double-click a .rpm             -> explains why it is not for this system\n"
"    Applications menu -> Tandem     -> the panel, with everything\n"
"\n"
"  Check the environment with:  tandem doctor"
msgstr ""
"  Tandem instalado.\n"
"\n"
"    Clique duas vezes num .exe ou .msi   -> roda no Windows (Wine)\n"
"    Clique duas vezes num .apk ou .xapk  -> instala no Android\n"
"    Clique duas vezes num .AppImage      -> roda direto, sem instalar\n"
"    Clique duas vezes num .jar           -> roda no Java\n"
"    Clique duas vezes num .deb           -> instala, conferindo antes\n"
"    Clique duas vezes num .rpm           -> explica por que nao serve aqui\n"
"    Menu de aplicativos -> Tandem        -> painel com tudo\n"
"\n"
"  Verifique o ambiente com:  tandem doctor"

